[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: ETH-W5500 Extension Hardware Architecture
UID: ETH-HWA
VERSION: 0.1
OPTIONS:
  VIEW_STYLE: Table

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: architecture.sgra

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: Circuit blocks of the W5500 Ethernet extension (ETH_W5500.kicad_sch).

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Circuit blocks

[BLOCK]
UID: ETH-HWA-001
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Circuit
TITLE: Host connector
DESCRIPTION: J1 2x5 socket. SPI, nINT and RSTn (SDA_X) go directly to U3.
REALIZATION: J1
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-001
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-005

[BLOCK]
UID: ETH-HWA-002
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Circuit
TITLE: Supply
DESCRIPTION: >>>
JP4 connects 3V3BUD to +3.3V, JP5 connects 5VBUD to +5V, which feeds U2
(AP1117-33). L2 ferrite to +3.3VA, GNDA tied to GND through R2. C11/C15 22 uF
bulk.
<<<
REALIZATION: JP4, JP5, U2, L2, R2, C11, C14, C15, C30
VARIANTS: >>>
JP4 closed = main board 3.3 V (proposed default). JP5 + U2 = 5 V via LDO.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-002
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-003
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-004

[BLOCK]
UID: ETH-HWA-003
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Circuit
TITLE: W5500 and clock
DESCRIPTION: >>>
U3 W5500 with decoupling, Y1 25 MHz with C7/C8 and R1/R3, EXRES1 R4 to GNDA,
PMODE jumpers JP1-JP3.
<<<
REALIZATION: U3, Y1, C7, C8, R1, R3, R4, JP1-JP3
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-006
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-007
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-010
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-011
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-021

[BLOCK]
UID: ETH-HWA-004
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Circuit
TITLE: MDI and magnetics
DESCRIPTION: >>>
TX: R5/R6 33 Ohm series, R13/R14 49.9 Ohm to 3V3A, centre tap R15/C22. RX:
R7/R8, R11/R12, R16-R19. TR1 1:1 transformer. Bob Smith R20/R21 and
C28/C31/C32/C34 to GNDPWR, C33 1 nF 2 kV to GND.
<<<
REALIZATION: R5-R21, C20-C22, C28, C31-C34, TR1
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-020
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-022
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-023
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-024

[BLOCK]
UID: ETH-HWA-005
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Circuit
TITLE: RJ45 and LEDs
DESCRIPTION: >>>
J2 with integrated LEDs driven from LED_LNK/LED_ACT via R23/R22 330 Ohm.
Shield on GNDPWR.
<<<
REALIZATION: J2, R22, R23, D9, D10
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-025

[BLOCK]
UID: ETH-HWA-006
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Circuit
TITLE: PoE connector
DESCRIPTION: >>>
J3 passes the spare pairs to an external module and takes back +5V or +3.3V.
<<<
REALIZATION: J3
VARIANTS: DNP proposed.
COMMENT: >>>
With PoE feeding +3.3V and JP4 closed, PoE also supplies the main board; check
for backfeed against the main board buck.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-041

[BLOCK]
UID: ETH-HWA-007
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Module
TITLE: PCB
DESCRIPTION: >>>
Two layers, 59.9 x 34.7 mm, separate GND/GNDA areas joined at R2, GNDPWR under
the jack.
<<<
REALIZATION: ETH_W5500.kicad_pcb
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-030
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-031
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-HW-032

